{title: Teri Meri Kahaani}
{artist: Chirantan Bhat Arijit Singh}
{key: Gm}

{c: Verse 1}
[Gm]Mujh mein safar, tu karti [Dm]rahe,        [Am]Har ek saans mein, guzarti [Dm]rahe
Shaam o [Gm]Amsubah, tu mera,        Tere [Dm]bina, kya mera
Do jism [Gm]jaan, ek hain,        Na [C]hona kabhi tu juda
Teri meri [Dm]kahani hai barisho ka [Bb]paani
Banke jo ishq [Dm]barse teri meri [Bb]kahani
Teri meri [Dm]kahani, hai barisho ka [Bb]paani
Banke jo ishq [Dm]barse, teri meri [Bb]kahani,        [F]Humse ye jo bhi, harqat [Am]huyi hai
[Bb]Mohabbat [C]mohabat mohabat [Dm]hui hai,        Kuch itne hai [Gm]hum tum,
Kami kuch [C]nahi hai,        [Dm]Jitna bhi jeena hai, tujhko [C]hi jeena hai
[Bb]Jeete rahe jis [C]tarah,        Shaam o [Gm]Amsubah, tu mera
Tere [Dm]bina, kya mera,        Do jism [Gm]jaan, ek hain
Na [C]hona kabhi tu juda,        Teri meri [Dm]kahani hai barisho ka [Bb]paani
Banke jo ishq [Dm]barse teri meri [Bb]kahani
Teri meri [Dm]kahani, hai barisho ka [Bb]paani
Banke jo ishq [Dm]barse, teri meri [Bb]kahani
